<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future Kingpin!\rThe floor in here unstable. It’s LAVA,\nbro. Who approved this?!\rClair use mythical, SACRED Dragon\nhomies. They don’t take damage easy.\rBut they weak to Ice moves. She hate\nwhen people know that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AYO! You beat Clair! HARD!\rWhatever she say, you a real Hustler.\nI think. Don’t quote me.\rI’d still do what Clair say though.\nShe PETTY. She’ll key your car.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future Kingpin!\rThe floor in here unstable. It’s LAVA,\nbro. Who approved this?!\rClair use mythical, SACRED Dragon\nhomies. They don’t take damage easy.\rBut they weak to Ice moves. She hate\nwhen people know that.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair: I’m Clair.\rThe WORLD’S best Dragon master. I\ncould beat the Elite Four. I just\fchoose not to.\rYou still wanna run up on ME?\r...Fine. Let’s do this. Don’t cry when\nI win. It’s tacky.\rAs a Block Boss, I go FULL POWER! On\neverybody! Even kids! ESPECIALLY\fkids!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair: I DON’T accept this.\rI might’ve lost, but you still ain’t\nready for the Big League. I said so.\rI know. Take the Dragon-master test.\rBehind this Block is the Dragon’s Den.\nThere’s a shrine in the middle. Go\fthere.\rProve you lost your lazy ideals, and\nMAYBE I’ll give you a Chain.\fMaybe. I’m emotional right now.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair: What’s the matter?\rToo much for you? Typical.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair: You KEPT me waitin’!\nDo you know who I AM?!\rHere! Take this!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair: That’s Dragon Beam.\rWell, Dragon Beam is like...umm...\nNever mind!\rIt’s some kinda huge energy.\nIf you don’t want it, you don’t\fgotta take it. Whatever.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What is this? You ain’t got room?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Clair: What’s the matter?\rAin’t you headed to the Big League?\rYour face tellin’ me you got unfinished\nbusiness... It’s a hella readable face.\rHold up! You came from New Bark Town,\nwhere Professor Elm’s Lab is, right?\rGo back to New Bark Town.\rWhatever you gotta face, it’s gon’ be\nharder.\rBut don’t you DARE give up!\rIf you do, I’ma feel even WORSE about\nlosin’ to you!\r...\nGive it everythin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blackthorn City Block\nLava Floor. Watch Your Step.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0631_T30GYM0101_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blackthorn City Block\rBoss: Clair\nGot Ran Through By:\f{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}</language>
	</row>
</body>
